# Quick controls, Shutdown by touch (a tap acts at once, no dialog) and its failure path: the service refuses (the fake
# service answers -1), the page says "Shutdown failed" in red and the buttons come back; a second tap then runs it.
# Review only: no golden.
title quick controls shutdown
review
env APPLAUNCH_DEV 0
env APPLAUNCH_QUICKCTL_ADAPTERS all
apps Settings CLI "Quick controls" SSH Calculator
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
launch "Quick controls"
wait 600
expect_power none
quickctl fail power
tapbutton Shutdown
wait 600
shot qc_shutdown_failed
expect_text "Shutdown failed"
expect_power Shutdown
quickctl fail none
